' imported from the release disk (MASTER D1 231231.d81), "i.EM", with:
'   C64List4_04.exe -txt -keycase -varcase -alpha:alt (as tools/detok.sh
'   --keep-spaces), then jumps to lines 3_0-preface.lbl doesn't name written
'   {$3x}nnn so C64List leaves them as they are (detok.sh would write [nnnn]).
'   Unchanged, this builds the release's program byte for byte, except
'   capitals in rem text ($61-$7a).

{uses:3_0-preface.lbl}
{alpha:alt}

